{"candidateAnswer":"It reminds her of her mom.","evidence":"[D12:3 | 4:30 pm on 9 April, 2023] Deborah: My mom was interested in art. She believed art could give out strong emotions and uniquely connect us. When I go to an art show, it's like we're still experiencing it together even though she's gone. It's hard but comforting.","itemId":"urn:uuid:ef08cb5f-f470-58bd-b027-e0f26410b44e","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:450e91e73d3aa85293ea90919d2d6b875584b0897d632a16289d14ecad637750","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What does Deborah find comforting about going to art shows?","referenceAnswer":"It makes her feel like she's still experiencing it with her mom","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"450e91e73d3aa85293ea90919d2d6b875584b0897d632a16289d14ecad637750"}}]}